      "writtenOn": "2025-05-01T16:04:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This suggestion would break backwards compatibility with VMs on system updates, so I don\u0027t think we can do that. We can set a minimum version to 1.2 now, since we have not launched support at all so far, but one we ship a version of this, the VM needs to be allowed to stay on 1.2 even if the host moves to 1.3.",
      "parentUuid": "e9693927_39cfce22",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1069,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1073,
        "endChar": 2
