      "writtenOn": "2025-05-02T09:22:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL is enforcing one particular version so I don\u0027t know why you bring backwards compatibility in the discussion. Until we have backwards compatibility support in the hyp this suggestion can stay as is. Please note that this is the same behaviour as in the previous CL so I don\u0027t see why the guest should behave any different.",
      "parentUuid": "44d17d8e_0b7bdff8",
